skills.description:
Return the 10-title catalog, simulated stock, and the selling price (the verified list price).

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "list_books"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["books"], "properties": {"books": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/book"}}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

Return one catalog record by ISBN-13 or by rank.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "get_book"}, "isbn13": {"type": "string"}, "rank": {"type": "integer"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["book"], "properties": {"book": {"$ref": "#/book"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

Case-insensitive match on title or author.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action", "query"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "search_books"}, "query": {"type": "string"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["books"], "properties": {"books": {"type": "array"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

Create a customer. Email must contain a name, a domain, and a dot. tax_id is optional and is not checked against a registry.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action", "name", "email", "billing"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "register_customer"}, "name": {"type": "string"}, "email": {"type": "string"}, "tax_id": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "billing": {"type": "object", "required": ["line1", "city", "postal_code", "country"], "properties": {"line1": {"type": "string"}, "line2": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "city": {"type": "string"}, "region": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "postal_code": {"type": "string"}, "country": {"type": "string"}}}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["customer"], "properties": {"customer": {"type": "object"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

Look up a customer by customer_id or email.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "get_customer"}, "customer_id": {"type": "string"}, "email": {"type": "string"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["customer"], "properties": {"customer": {"type": "object"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

