Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

Add a priced title. A title with a null list price is not for sale. cart_id may be omitted when the A2A contextId already has an open cart.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "add_to_cart"}, "cart_id": {"type": "string"}, "context_id": {"type": "string"}, "isbn13": {"type": "string"}, "rank": {"type": "integer"}, "quantity": {"type": "integer"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["cart"], "properties": {"cart": {"type": "object"}}}

