Return the open cart and line totals.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "view_cart"}, "cart_id": {"type": "string"}, "context_id": {"type": "string"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["cart"], "properties": {"cart": {"type": "object"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

Turn the cart into an order awaiting sandbox payment. Tax is a simulated 8 percent of the merchandise subtotal. Shipping is a flat 5.00 USD. Neither figure comes from the bestseller list. Simulated stock is reserved.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "checkout"}, "cart_id": {"type": "string"}, "context_id": {"type": "string"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["order"], "properties": {"order": {"type": "object"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

SANDBOX payment simulator, not a live charge. 4242424242424242 succeeds (Visa). 4000000000000002 declines. The full card number is never stored or returned; only brand and last4. Set STRIPE_SECRET_KEY to send the same call to Stripe test mode instead. A successful sandbox charge creates the invoice and attempts the confirmation email.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action", "order_id", "card_number"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "pay"}, "order_id": {"type": "string"}, "card_number": {"type": "string"}, "exp_month": {"type": "integer"}, "exp_year": {"type": "integer"}, "cvc": {"type": "string"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["order", "payment"], "properties": {"order": {"type": "object"}, "payment": {"type": "object"}, "invoice": {"type": "object"}, "notification": {"type": "object"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

Build a sequential UBL 2.1 / EN 16931-style XML invoice and a PDF for a paid order. The same invoice is returned if it already exists. Download URLs require an unguessable token.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action", "order_id"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "generate_invoice"}, "order_id": {"type": "string"}}}

Output JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["invoice"], "properties": {"invoice": {"type": "object"}}}

Send this as an A2A DataPart for a deterministic result that does not call a model. A TextPart is handled by the language model, which calls the same tool. Every result also includes state and message.

